  "ruleText": "Abfd 101.01 Purpose. These rules have been adopted by the committee on architectural barrier-free design for the purpose of implementing its responsibilities under RSA 275-C:10-C:18.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Abfd 100) #5720, eff 1-1-94, EXPIRED: 1-1-00\n\nNew. #7211, INTERIM, eff 3-1-00, EXPIRED: 6-29-00\n\nNew. #7367, eff 9-27-00; ss by #7473, eff 4-5-01",
